            "reviewBody": "I'm torn on how to rate this. The topping was really good and one I'd definitely make again. Cook time is way off though. 45 minutes at 350 would have ruined the lobster. Mine were done in 15 minutes.",
            "datePublished": "2020-09-18T17:10:41.823Z"
