            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Frank Baik"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Creates a very tasty Parmesan butter crust. Very rich. Only baked my tails 30 min with 3 more on broil for extra browning. Smaller tails take less time. Wish I remembered to add some garlic powder. Will Make again",
            "datePublished": "2024-09-21T00:33:40.857Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "amydoll"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Wow. So simple, fast, with ingredients I already have in the fridge. My favorite type of recipe. I loved this. Excellent with a splash of lemon juice added. Very, very good flavor. I had some left over so I spread a thin layer on some crackers and quickly broiled it in my toaster oven. So bad for me (I know), so rich, but SO GOOD. Thanks for sharing this simple recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2004-07-02T05:57:31.950Z"
          },
          {
